  "id": "cheesy-spinach-and-artichoke-dip",
  "name": "Cheesy Spinach and Artichoke Dip",
  "subtitle": "A warm, creamy dip with spinach, artichokes, and a browned cheese topping.",
  "description": "Combine spinach and artichokes with a creamy cheese mixture, bake until bubbling, and serve warm with tortilla chips or crudités.",
